    "text": "BfJ  -  Regional Central Adoption Authorities of the Youth Welfare Offices Regional Central Adoption Authorities of the Youth Welfare Offices Association of Local Goverment Bodies for Youth and Social Welfare Matters for the State of Baden-Württemberg Youth Welfare Department Central Adoption Authority Lindenspürstr. 39 70176 Stuttgart, Germany Telephone: +49 711 6375-0 Telefax: +49 711 6375-449 E-Mail: zas@kvjs.de Homepage: http://www.kvjs.de Central Adoption Authority of Bavaria Winzerer Str. 9 80797 München, Germany Telephone: +49 89 124793-2697 Telefax: +49 89 124793-2280 E-Mail: adoption@zbfs.bayern.de Homepage: http://www.blja.bayern.de Central Adoption Office Berlin-Brandenburg Heinrich-Mann-Allee 107 14473 Potsdam, Germany Telephone: +49 331 866-3718 Telefax: +49 331 27548-4890 E-Mail: ZABB@mbjs.brandenburg.de Homepage: https://mbjs.brandenburg.de/kinder-und-jugend/adoption/zustaendigkeiten-der-zabb.html Conjoint Central Adoption Authority of the Federal States Bremen, Hamburg, Lower Saxony and Schleswig-Holstein - Department for Labour, Social, Health, Family Affairs and Integration P.O. Box 761048 22060 Hamburg Telephone: +49 40 42863-5205 Telefax: +49 40 4273-10934 E-Mail: gza@bsfb.hamburg.de Homepage: http://www.hamburg.de/gza State Office for Health and Social Affairs Friedrich-Engels-Str. 47 19061 Schwerin, Germany Telephone: +49 385 588-59556 Telefax: +49 385 509-59000 E-Mail: za@lagus.mv-regierung.de Homepage: https://www.lagus.mv-regierung.de/LJA Central Adoption Office of the LVR-State Youth Welfare Office Rhineland Siegburger Str. 223 50679 Köln, Germany Telephone: +49 221 809-4041 Telefax: +49 221 809-4067 E-Mail: za.landesjugendamt@lvr.de Homepage: http://www.lvr.de Central Adoption Office of the LWL-Regional Youth Welfare Office Westphalia Warendorfer Str. 27 48145 Münster, Germany Telephone: +49 251 591-3621 Telefax: +49 251 591-6898 E-Mail: zas@lwl.org Homepage: https://www.lwl-landesjugendamt.de/de/ Joint Central Adoption Office